  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery Support to Kenya Investment Authority (KenInvest)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kenya Investment Authority will be informed by 3 strands: First is to work closely with KenInvest leadership to devise a capacity building plan for a KenInvest Deal Room. Second, will be to support KenInvest in the execution of this plan, setting up new delivery structures, and recruiting and onboarding government secondees and TBI embedded advisors, ensuring close coordination with other development partner supported initiatives. Lastly embedding advisors, with oversight and ongoing support from TBI&#x2019;s global advisory teams (with expertise in industrial policy, energy, climate, investment, infrastructure, government delivery, and other relevant areas), will support KenInvest leadership to deliver tangible outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
